  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Green Power Project Readiness Enhancement</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project readiness financing (PRF) is proposed to complete detailed engineering studies, environmental and social impact assessments, and bid document preparation for two hydropower projects: (i) the Bunakha hydropower project (180 megawatt [MW]), and (ii) the Nyera Amari hydropower project (404 MW). In 2019, these projects were included in Bhutan&apos;s power system master plan for 2040.</narrative>
  </description>
